        }
      ],
      "id": "post_c8d0d8f7a7e778cc33097848_b1695",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "二-️-关键PWA-环境与跨域限制",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "这是配置过程中最需要注意的地方：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_c8d0d8f7a7e778cc33097848_b1696",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "Cent 是一款 PWA 应用，直接运行在浏览器中。",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 由于浏览器的安全策略（CORS），大多数 AI 厂商（如Google、字节跳动等）默认",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "不允许",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "网页直接发起 API 请求。如果你直接填写厂商的官方地址，可能会遇到“网络请求失败”或“跨域拦截”的报错。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_c8d0d8f7a7e778cc33097848_b1697",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "解决方案：使用 API 代理",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_c8d0d8f7a7e778cc33097848_b1698",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "解决方案使用-API-代理",
        "level": 3
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "为了正常使用，你需要配置一个",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "代理服务器",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "来中转请求：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_c8d0d8f7a7e778cc33097848_b1699",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "🔗 ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "styles": {},
                  "text": "使用Relayr代理协议URL",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "href": "https://glink25.github.io/post/%25E4%25BD%25BF%25E7%2594%25A8Relayr%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E7%2590%2586%25E5%258D%258F%25E8%25AE%25AEURL/",
              "type": "link"
            },
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "（参考此文完成代理部署）。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
